              "text": "கலைஞர் (kalaiñar) is kalai, \"arts and learning\", with the respectful ending -ñar, \"one who\". DEDR files kalai under kal, \"to learn\" (DEDR 1297), but compares Sanskrit kalā, \"art\"; many treat it as a loan."
